  "provenance": "macOS 27.0 26A5425a LaunchServices runtime encodes LSVersionNumber as {LSVersionNumber=[32C]}; native provider writes 32-byte indirect result from one CFStringRef. SDK exports both symbols without public declarations. Native x86 provider reads by-value LSVersionNumber stack blocks, 32-byte stride for Compare; native 27 ARM and native x86 agree on 64-bit component/hash/Compare results and 32-bit DYLDVersion result. SIOpenIndex: genuine 27 ARM provider 0x1a1385dc4 preserves x6 and 0x1a1385f40 copies 24 bytes through it; x86 provider 0x7ff903b04d9f reads inline rbp+0x10, then arg7/+0x28, arg8/+0x30,arg9/+0x38. ARM mds 0x100072d64..0x100072d90 passes callback triple via x6, arg7/x7, arg8/SP,arg9/SP+8; return tested as w0. Three fixup targets are guest function starts. SICreateNewIndex genuine27 ARM copies24B from x5 at0x1a1713c94, x86 copies inline rbp+0x10 at0x7ff903ee201d, trailing args +0x28/+0x30. TCCAccessCheckAuditToken ARM x1 indirect32B token and x2 options, x86 token inline rbp+0x10 and options RSI; mds0x100014d40 copies32B and passes x1 address. Both providers return zero-extended byte result for TCC. SIUserCtxCreate (11-02 r13s): genuine27 ARM mds 0x10007cfb0..cff8 memcpy 0x450 B to sp+0x90 -> x2, 32 B pair to sp+0x50 -> x3, x4..x7, stack +0/+8/+0x10 8 B, +0x18 strb (1 B), +0x20 8 B; native x86 provider copies 138 qwords from rbp+16, 32 B at rbp+1120/1136, args8-9 rbp+1152, arg10 +1168, byte +1176, arg12 +1184, args4-7 rdx/rcx/r8/r9. Result x0 -> pointer. SIUserCtxGetAuditToken (11-02 r13t): genuine27 ARM mds 0x1000810c4..cc zeroes 32 B at sp+0x60, x8=&result, x0=ctx; native x86 provider: rdi=sret result, rsi=ctx, copies ctx+0x10..0x2f (32 B), NULL ctx -> zeroes. Generic door passed ctx as the sret pointer (mds SIGSEGV 0x100172380, CFRelease 0x100171070 downstream). r13u: CMTimeRange {CMTime start, duration} 48 B and CMTimeMapping {CMTimeRange source, target} 96 B (CoreMedia public headers); both > 16 B = memory class on x86, indirect on arm64. | MDPlistObject24 = {void*base; ulong len; uint off; uchar type; pad[3]} (24 bytes, MEMORY class on x86-64, by pointer on arm64): x86 MetadataUtilities readers take it on the stack at 0x10(%rbp) (offset u32 at 0x20, type u8 at 0x24), arm64 readers take x0 = pointer to it (offset ldr w,[x0,#0x10], type ldrb [x0,#0x14]); producers write 24 bytes through x8 / rdi. MDQueryBatchingParams = 6 x CFIndex (48 bytes) by value to MDQuerySetBatchingParameters (arm x1 = pointer, x86 stack 0x10..0x3f). Evidence: VERIFY.md.",
